rops":{},"children":["23"]},"不要指望买东西改善心情或身份感"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-24","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"不要为了「在周围人里往上挪一档」多花钱换房、换车、换圈子"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-25","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"不要相信「意志力像肌肉，用一会儿就没了」"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-26","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"不要指望吃早餐或 16:8 轻断食帮你控制体重，吃饭时间挑你能长期坚持的"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-27","className":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"不要相信「手淫伤身」「戒色才能变好」，真正要看的是有没有耽误睡觉、工作和关系"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-28","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"不要花钱做「性取向矫正」「同性恋治疗」，也不要把家里人送去"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-29","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"不要指望学会「正确搬运姿势」、上搬运培训就能防腰痛，要减的是搬的重量和次数，平时多锻炼"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-30","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"不要指望骨折之后猛补钙、喝骨头汤能让骨头长得更快"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-31","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"不要指望靠 AI 聊天机器人自己判断病情和法律问题，看病、打官司、花大钱之前，把它说的依据找到原文核一遍"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/06-32","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["32"]},"不要因为「人随时会死，早点把钱花完才快乐」就不存钱，三十岁的人约九成能活到六十岁"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page","data-tip-locales":"zh,en,ru,es,ja,vi"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"当前位置"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book"},"children":["阅读全书"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book/06"},"children":["第 6 章 · 反面清单"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"06-27"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":